    "title": "Solutions being sought for Great Creek bridge",
    "text": "There will be a meeting to consider solutions for the North Road bridge at the Great Creek from 5:30-7:30 p.m. Wednesday, April 1, at the library, 26 North Road.\nThe meeting is being hosted by Protect Conanicut Coastline, which was founded in 2021 to preserve the “unique, spectacular coastline” of Jamestown.",
